hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3011","Narrated to us Salm ibn Junādah (RA), narrated to us Wakīʿ (RA), from Hishām ibn Saʿīd (RA), from Nāfiʿ (RA), from Ibn ʿUmar (RA), who said:\n\I asked Bilāl (RA) where the Messenger of Allāh (ﷺ) had prayed. He said: 'He prayed at the front of the House"," between it and the wall"," there were three cubits—or approximately three cubits.'\""\nAbū ʿĀmir (RA) expressed doubt in the narration.\n\n**CHAPTER:**"""
